sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant O as Orchestrator
  participant INV as Inventory
  participant CART as Cart

  Note over INV: Cleanup task runs on a schedule
  INV->>INV: find reservations past TTL, decrement Reserved_Qty
  INV-->>O: alert: reservations expired (session ids)
  O->>CART: mark_expired(session, reservation_ids)
  CART-->>O: items kept in basket, flagged EXPIRED
  Note over O: On next checkout, validate_reservations fails fast and the user is offered a re-reserve
